body:
Dear all,

The app is very useful and practical, but find below some suggestions, in my opinion, that is going to improve the activity control and usability.

1) Habit types % conclusion (habits concluded/total specific habit);

2) Instead “Ignore Habit”, use “Not Concluded”, and at the Statistics Menu, show the % of those habits not concluded;

3) Besides the %, it’s going to be more visual a graphic showing the differences types of habits and their % of conclusions;

4) Divide habits in Macro Subjects;

I hope to hear from you soon.

Rgs
Alexandre Kovacs
